{"4330620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unlatched", "steam_appid": 4330620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4894360], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlatched</strong> is a single-player game that replicates asymmetrical horror, but offline with bots. Experience the same thrilling, heart-racing chases without the toxic online behavior or server issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the victim, Haley Johnson, an aspiring reporter who finds herself amidst three sadistic killers. Will you escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/23ed165a9c08c8210e6c9a25e93bf641.poster.avif?t=1783001681\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/23ed165a9c08c8210e6c9a25e93bf641.webm?t=1783001681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/23ed165a9c08c8210e6c9a25e93bf641.mp4?t=1783001681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose <strong>Stealth</strong> by hiding in the shadows, using distractions, and finding keys to unlock doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/2e88394c0839bb995093a77591e88a79.poster.avif?t=1783001681\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/2e88394c0839bb995093a77591e88a79.webm?t=1783001681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/2e88394c0839bb995093a77591e88a79.mp4?t=1783001681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose <strong>Violence</strong> by breaking down doors and attacking your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/cd3d83fa05d235afb1f145e876b64957.poster.avif?t=1783001681\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/cd3d83fa05d235afb1f145e876b64957.webm?t=1783001681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/cd3d83fa05d235afb1f145e876b64957.mp4?t=1783001681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever you choose, remember to... <strong>JUST LEAVE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlatched</strong> is a single-player game that replicates asymmetrical horror, but offline with bots. Experience the same thrilling, heart-racing chases without the toxic online behavior or server issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the victim, Haley Johnson, an aspiring reporter who finds herself amidst three sadistic killers. Will you escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/23ed165a9c08c8210e6c9a25e93bf641.poster.avif?t=1783001681\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/23ed165a9c08c8210e6c9a25e93bf641.webm?t=1783001681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/23ed165a9c08c8210e6c9a25e93bf641.mp4?t=1783001681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose <strong>Stealth</strong> by hiding in the shadows, using distractions, and finding keys to unlock doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/2e88394c0839bb995093a77591e88a79.poster.avif?t=1783001681\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/2e88394c0839bb995093a77591e88a79.webm?t=1783001681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/2e88394c0839bb995093a77591e88a79.mp4?t=1783001681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose <strong>Violence</strong> by breaking down doors and attacking your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/cd3d83fa05d235afb1f145e876b64957.poster.avif?t=1783001681\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/cd3d83fa05d235afb1f145e876b64957.webm?t=1783001681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4330620/extras/cd3d83fa05d235afb1f145e876b64957.mp4?t=1783001681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragr